OL,3,GNEWSAThree more arrests after couple
OL,4,Aand two children killed in arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardai (Irish police) have arrested
OL,7,Fthree more people in connection with a
OL,8,Fsuspected arson attack which killed
OL,9,Ffour family members in Waterford.
OL,11,FA man in his 50s and two women in their
OL,12,F30s were arrested by gardai on Tuesday.
OL,13,FA man aged in his 20s and a woman in
OL,14,Fher 30s were previously charged in
OL,15,Fconnection with the fatal attack.
OL,17,FKim English, Philip English and two of
OL,18,Ftheir children - nine-year-old Jayden
OL,19,Fand 12-year-old Callum - died after
OL,20,Ftheir home in Birch Avenue, on the
OL,21,Foutskirts of Waterford was set on fire
OL,22,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
